ather and waves or currents, two weather models… The splitted screens can display charts at different scales.\n\nCreate or import locations, combine them with GRIB forecast models and get a holistic view of the sea conditions.\n\nDefault Models and Charts\n————————————\nGFS global forecast model at 0.25 °, 0.5 °, 1 ° and 2 ° resolutions. \nBING global chart\nOSM (Opens Street Map) global chart\n\nOptional Models (in-app purchase):\n———————————————————\nWeather\n--------\nNAM USA    \nGEM Global    \nCOAMPS Europe, West Atlantic, Central America, East Pacific    \nICON-EU Europe    \nARPEGE Global, Europe    \nAROME France, Antilles, Guyane, Polynésie, Calédonie, Indien  \nAROME HD France\nWRF France, Europe, Greece, NW Africa, Azores, Lesser Antilles, Greater Antilles    \n\nWaves\n-------\nMFWAM Global, Europe, France\nFNMOC WW3 Global, Europe\n\nCurrents\n---------\nMyOcean Global, IBI, NWS, Baltic, Med\nNCOM AMSEAS, USEAST, ALASKA, SOCAL, HAWAII", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "FR"], "fileSizeBytes": "507629568", "formattedPrice": "￦29,000", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/weather4d-lite/id418723845?uo=4", "trackContentRating": "4+", "sellerUrl": "http://www.weather4d.com", "averageUserRating": 0, "trackCensoredName": "Weather4D Lite", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackId": 418723845, "trackName": "Weather4D Lite", "userRatingCount": 0}]}